{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "combo-s-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 玩家普攻｜结构图\nPlayerCombo持有原激活内的段序、输入请求和Task／窗口／移动资源。\nASC持有原请求与终止认证；Animation提供Montage／姿态契约；CMC唯一执行胶囊位移；Combat查询并去重命中。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|连段说明]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1510,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 输入请求边界\nIA_Attack采用Pressed；ASC活跃Spec InputPressed→WaitComboInput。\n任务给SourceStep/RequestId，Combo核原资源门。\n前点请求拒绝且不重播；过点新按下才按唯一Next换段。\n真实移动资格来自原Source/CMC；已held可在点开放时接管。\n激活重试归ASC/Hero，不替代段内换段。\n[[Input/结构|输入职责]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPlayerComboAbility\nInitialize/Body接收已签Original；段/token/请求来源与原FStepMotionResources归Combo。\nHandleMontageNotify / EnableStepInterruption：认证原点事实，唯一bInterruptionOpen归本原资源；新步关门。\nHandleInputPressed：核SourceStep/RequestId/门/Next，立即换段，不存前点输入。\nStartStep：持完整Source、原Task/CMC Handle/Scope；Section仅投影，自然须两原完成事实。\nContext Cleanup先脱门/成员再退原资源；Required失败正式End，普通Cancel保持。\n[[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|原终止]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOComboStep[] / 正式GA\nMontage、Main/End、MotionSlotName/Scale、InterruptionNotifyName、唯一Next、Rate、Damage/Poise与TraceShape。\n每Montage唯一精确stock原生Montage Notify点；名称Event.Montage.CancelPoint，Next=1/2/0。\nValidateComboConfiguration核必需来源、点链接/时间/唯一性；无效明确失败。\nNext=INDEX_NONE显式关闭攻击接续；InputBufferSeconds仅历史存值。\n完整End/独立Blend/旧窗口保持，无新请求不循环。",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-task",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Montage Task / WaitComboInput\nCombo持原Task/native token；输入Task给真实SourceStep/RequestId，不存GA门。\nConfigureOriginalMontageNotify：preReady固定唯一原点；ResolveOriginalMontageNotify校验配置。\nNotifyReceived(FGGYGOMontageNotifyFact)：原Montage/Mesh/实例ID/名称/作者TriggerTime；可交付原自然blend。\nTryGetOriginalMontageNotifySnapshot：原点与实际位置；Section另有原快照/事实，无dt游标。\nTask持原Playback/Guard/scale/Ticket/订阅，精确退自身资源；Required历史OnFailed与普通回调保持。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|Task契约]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-anim",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Animation Source / Required Pose / CMC\nBuildSourceBindingRange冻结原Main→End连续来源；CMC BeginMontageActionMotion / native RMS唯一执行XYZ胶囊。\nQuery/SubscribeQualifiedMovementIntent发布原Scope真实资格；CancelMontageActionMotionForMovement只退原Handle。\nNotifyMontageActionNaturalBlendOut许可原有限尾区间；ObserveMontageActionMotionCompletion发布末贡献消费事实。\nActionPoseSlot保留Body−Trajectory−MeshRef全XYZ姿态余量；Guard/节点求值归Animation，Task只持Ticket。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态执行]] · [[Movement/结构|移动契约]]",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-hit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Hero MeleeTrace / Builder / GE / Cue\nHeroCharacter持MeleeTraceComponent。\n服务器TryOpenOwnedTraceWindow→签发原窗口；SubscribeWindowHit→原Window/Actor/HitResult。\nCombat唯一做采样/去重/Tick；不决策伤害/GA终止。\nCombo校验Original/段/Task/Window，再BuildHitEffectPayload→Spec与Cue数据。\n合法GE经ASC Apply→GE/Execution/AttributeSet；显式无GE只走合法Cue。\nUnsubscribeWindowHit/CloseOwnedTraceWindow精确退原资源。\n[[Combat/结构|查询契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害链]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-network",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 强类型纠正与完成边界\nWaitComboInput给SourceStep/RequestId；ClientCorrectAbilityState(Spec,key,TargetData)只筛来源并转发。\nFGGYGOComboCorrectionData归Combo：段/位置/窗口/Revision；ReceiveAbilityCorrection核单项确切类型与范围。\nCurrentStepRequestId记录本步请求，旧接受按请求号拒回滚，支持03→01；合法不同步纠正沿StartStep(SafePosition)认证原点位置。\nRequestAbilityEnd/Cancel消费固定Original；结果历史不授后继权限。\nGA数据、ASC本地通知、Completed各有字段/时点；真实返回后受控调用方才续激活。\nraw无外层受控Try见证可清资源，但不发布协议Completed。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
